MODIFICATION STATEMENT

STHELAR-Adapt is a modified derivative of the CellViT framework. For
avoidance of doubt, all CellViT-derived files distributed here are to be
treated as modified unless a retained file header explicitly states that the
file is unchanged. In the corresponding source repository, CellViT-derived
material occurs principally under base_ml/, cell_segmentation/, datamodel/,
models/, preprocessing/, utils/, the associated configuration files, and
README_CellViT.md. Within this model release, the verification/export scripts,
adapter configuration and state, and release documentation are modified or
new STHELAR-Adapt material built for the CellViT framework.

Project modifications include STHELAR data conversion and label mapping,
spatial and complete-slide splitting, LoRA and AdaptFormer integration,
trainability controls, adapter export/loading/verification, experiment
configuration, evaluation, and release documentation. The repository's Git
history is the detailed record of those changes. This global notice does not
remove or replace any more-specific notice retained in an individual file.

PRETRAINED CHECKPOINTS AND ADAPTER STATE

The official CellViT-SAM-H x40 and CellViT-256 x40 base checkpoints are not
redistributed. Users must obtain them separately from CellViT and comply with
their applicable terms. Verified STHELAR-Adapt adapter exports contain trained
adapter/head state and changed mutable normalization buffers; they do not
contain unchanged frozen base parameters.

